{"slug":"workday-financials-online-training","id":"3046","title":"Workday Financials Online Training","description":"<h3>About Workday Financials Online Training</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Workday Financial Management goes beyond the fundamentals of accounting and focuses on the speed, agility, cost, and insights. it’s delivered within the cloud, and therefore the suite of unified applications includes a full range of finance and accounting capabilities, real-time business insights, and fully auditable process management. It features the functionality that’s designed uniquely for companies in specific industry verticals that include financial services, software and Internet services, education, government, and non-profit. Workday Financials Online Training also supports organizations with multinational financial reporting requirements.</p>\n<h3>Prerequisites For Learning Workday Financials Online Training</h3>\n<p>Basic knowledge of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Human Resource Management</li>\n<li>Any ERP like PeopleSoft, Oracle, SAP, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Terms And Conditions</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>We will Provide Supporting to resolve Student practical Issues.</li>\n<li>We will provide server Access and 100% Lab Facility.</li>\n<li>Resume Preparation.</li>\n<li>Interview Questions &amp; Answers.</li>\n<li>We will conduct mock interviews. Student also gets 100% supporting before and after getting job.</li>\n</ul>","curriculumInfo":"1 Section19 Lessons10 Weeks","sections":[{"id":"14","title":"Workday Financials Online Training Course Content","count":"19","collapsed":true,"items":[{"id":"3048","order":1,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/workday-financials-online-training/lessons/basic-navigation-of-workday-and-understanding-workday/","number":"2.1","title":"Basic Navigation Of Workday And Understanding Workday","status":"locked"},{"id":"3049","order":2,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/workday-financials-online-training/lessons/workday-organization/","number":"2.2","title